      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Pink boundary  = sandbox-recipes ns  (canonical CRD storage, non-MCP workloads — Phase-8 §4.8)\n•  Cyan boundary  = mcp-server ns  (MCP CRDs + rendered MCP workloads, HCC watches here)\n•  Blue boundary  = control-plane ns  (control-api, WRC reconciler, HCC)\n•  Green arrows (solid)  = WRC reconciler creates child resources  |  dotted = watch subscriptions\n•  Red arrow  = mcp-host Pod → MCP Service cross-namespace HTTP (DNS FQDN resolution)\n•  Orange arrow  = coordinator Pod → WRC REST endpoint (Bearer JWT, recipeNamespace claim)\n•  Purple arrow  = HCC watches McpServer + Context, creates NetworkPolicies L0–L3\n•  \"NO ownerRef (cross-ns)\" = ownerReferences stripped; GC via label-selector in cleanupDelegation / finalizationHandler",
